---
import Section from "./Section.astro";
---

<Section id="about" label="01 — About" title="A bit about me">
  <div class="max-w-3xl space-y-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-zinc-600 sm:text-lg">
    <p>
      I'm a backend developer with 4+ years of experience designing and
      shipping scalable, high-performance systems. My core stack is{" "}
      <span class="font-medium text-zinc-900">Go</span> and{" "}
      <span class="font-medium text-zinc-900">PHP</span>, where I build
      microservices and APIs that stay reliable under heavy, real-world traffic.
    </p>
    <p>
      Day to day I work across the whole backend lifecycle — from clean,
      well-tested domain code (Clean Architecture, TDD/BDD) to cloud
      infrastructure and deployments on Kubernetes, Helm, and AWS. I care about
      reliability, maintainability, and continuously sharpening my craft.
    </p>
  </div>
</Section>
